{
 "batchId": "b-0262",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_6861f08bac3e2748dedf",
   "sourceHash": "6861f08bac3e2748dedf18d508fe0922c4a0f24f7d50bc33ee3890a77c259b2d",
   "text": "Ananda 侧重于山间的高端养生体验，而 Kairali 则在阿育吠陀的发源地——喀拉拉——专注于临床阿育吠陀疗愈。治疗以院内草药制备和医师指导的治疗方案为支撑，着重于更深入的治疗效果，而非以休闲理疗为中心的体验。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned-word substitutions: 'luxury spa wellness' -> 高端养生体验; 'spa-centric' -> 以休闲理疗为中心. Competitor comparison carried from source; may warrant legal review."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d4086bf0535146897a7d",
   "sourceHash": "d4086bf0535146897a7d26629a514278d793f9b8a11f43a86b3b9fe0c9d7b1d3",
   "text": "Kairali 与阿育吠陀治疗中心有何不同？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d61f9d687ab44e3b5858",
   "sourceHash": "d61f9d687ab44e3b5858bc53cbac41fbbcfc2a49d5eaea8e0b5fbfbded7a03ec",
   "text": "与 Kerala Ayurveda 等提供门诊式疗法的连锁机构不同，Kairali 提供完整的住院式疗愈村体验。患者在同一个综合环境中住宿、用餐、接受治疗并康复，由医生和训练有素的阿育吠陀从业者亲自指导，完成结构化的康复治疗项目。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned-word substitution: 'Guests' -> 患者."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a4c9a1dca21103ef94f8",
   "sourceHash": "a4c9a1dca21103ef94f80035f1fe228cdad2a9ed9ff6c43acc6631c292bfa73f",
   "text": "为何选择 Kairali，而非严格遵循传统的阿育吠陀机构？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_56578f92ce516e6f3fa0",
   "sourceHash": "56578f92ce516e6f3fa08143cea3903f59df5f0bb4c2373560ae12114ab05b2a",
   "text": "Kalari Kovilakom 等疗养机构遵循极为严格的古典作息。Kairali 在保持纯正传统的同时，兼顾舒适、个性化与灵活性——无论是长期治疗性住院、生活方式重塑项目，还是较短期的健康疗养，都能适用，且不影响治疗质量。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned-word substitution: 'wellness getaways' (holiday sense) -> 较短期的健康疗养."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d4dbf8c74bffd90c3173",
   "sourceHash": "d4dbf8c74bffd90c3173fac8437fc52cf2d34a9ad219e6364ff65e133db9d14e",
   "text": "Kairali 与整合式健康疗养机构有何区别？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_667c9a65d7a0427ae40c",
   "sourceHash": "667c9a65d7a0427ae40c96deb7c16f660815ed899da2068b481adb609bd274a4",
   "text": "Pema Wellness 融合了多种疗愈方式，而 Kairali 则专注于将阿育吠陀作为一套完整的医学体系。治疗包括医师诊断、草药配方、饮食疗法和身体疗法，在统一的治疗路径中实施，确保疗愈的一致性与深度。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3958afe3263928bcb564",
   "sourceHash": "3958afe3263928bcb564ae4e9e4d1628cef2c96f5f1b977af3b4778c5c389b01",
   "text": "Kairali 与国际高端健康品牌相比如何？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned-word substitution: 'luxury' -> 高端."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a73994fdf20706849427",
   "sourceHash": "a73994fdf207068494270949629e927cf3430d12ad2f515b2ddf1cc388d65ab5",
   "text": "与 Six Senses Vana 等融合多种传统养生方式的国际疗养机构不同，Kairali 植根于世代相传、持续实践的单一古典阿育吠陀传承。这种专一性确保了治疗的纯正性与文化准确性，并依据阿育吠陀原理——而非潮流——量身定制。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_962a8c0bc59e4cae533f",
   "sourceHash": "962a8c0bc59e4cae533f4c409d16a04d157246fdd1c22d531fa39872330dc04b",
   "text": "从日常作息的简单调整开始：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c9f64d0169274de634b8",
   "sourceHash": "c9f64d0169274de634b870e7c76d5a7bbd3248c660c55a122a6fdb7294c8ee64",
   "text": "在您住院期间，我们的健康顾问将为您提供个性化建议。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3d7c2ede4810eea2f3c2",
   "sourceHash": "3d7c2ede4810eea2f3c2bb5c661342bfc5f7f5887cd4d4a990eda53b62d3784a",
   "text": "督夏（Dosha）是三种身体能量——",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment: followed by Vata term."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_75e6b7d85ecd62aa24a7",
   "sourceHash": "75e6b7d85ecd62aa24a71a5c4b72e599a08ce3f4f4f84f5c9d00f3047792b73c",
   "text": "（风与空），",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment following Vata."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2e81ab72bc9c6cc05e07",
   "sourceHash": "2e81ab72bc9c6cc05e0777367bfff834bdac0ce98a8a2b913dfc3df1bfd13870",
   "text": "（火与水）以及",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment following Pitta; precedes Kapha."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8bf95f6a1a23348872c3",
   "sourceHash": "8bf95f6a1a23348872c355c424e6a3fbb3c77975b97cbeb1abc46b2b938dfafc",
   "text": "（土与水）——它们主导着一切身体与心理过程。了解您独特的督夏构成，有助于确定最适合您体质的治疗、饮食和生活方式。在 Kairali，我们会在您抵达后进行全面的督夏评估，以定制您的健康治疗项目。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment following Kapha."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a30793d4bbb049958ec1",
   "sourceHash": "a30793d4bbb049958ec1822720f9d538f3f351024df429d1eb8c48935cfcf06e",
   "text": "督夏（Dosha）是三种身体能量——瓦塔（Vata）（风与空）、皮塔（Pitta）（火与水）以及卡法（Kapha）（土与水）——它们主导着一切身体与心理过程。了解您独特的督夏构成，有助于确定最适合您体质的治疗、饮食和生活方式。在 Kairali，我们会在您抵达后进行全面的督夏评估，以定制您的健康治疗项目。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
